    <data key="d0">From Scratch b-dash Big Data Resource Manager Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nM-AkqNh7Yo</data>
    <data key="d2">From Scratch's b-dash SaaS marketing platform leverages a custom Resource Manager running on EC2 to dynamically manage and allocate spot EMR clusters, reducing compute costs by over 50% while processing terabytes of data daily.</data>
    <data key="d3">Analytics, Big Data, Dynamic Compute Management</data>
    <data key="d4">True</data>
